--- KILL CONDITIONS (pre-registered above; status now) ---
  [PASS] K1: true lambda_2(N) >= 0 at all sampled N (500, 1000, 2000) -- no numerical contradiction of RH
  [PASS] K2: synthetic lambda_n^{syn}(N) >= 0 (expected: term-wise positivity for Re = 1/2 points)
